{
    "about": "Shared by tests/TriageProtocolTest.php (triageEvaluate / normalizeTriageCardNo in includes/functions-triage.php) and tests/js/triage.test.js (the same functions in assets/js/triage.js). Every leaf of both protocol trees is here, so a changed branch in either language fails CI. expect null = incomplete or invalid answers.",
